jei.immersivenuclear.quicklime.info=Burnt from diorite in the IE Coke Oven. Neutralizes the chemical effluent in the IE Mixer (it becomes neutralized sludge) and goes into the Precipitating Agent.
jei.immersivenuclear.neutralized_sludge.info=Chemical effluent neutralized with quicklime in the IE Mixer. Filtering it into neutralization cake and water comes in a later version.
jei.immersivenuclear.neutralization_cake.info=Solid left when the neutralized sludge is filtered. 4 cakes make 1 Impure Agglomerate.
jei.immersivenuclear.impure_agglomerate.info=Heavy building block made of neutralization cake or mineral residue (4 of either).
jei.immersivenuclear.precipitating_agent.info=Goes into the Precipitation Unit (future machine) to turn the uranium into a solid.
jei.immersivenuclear.wet_uranium_concentrate.info=Comes out of the Precipitation Unit (future machine) and goes to the Industrial Dryer.
jei.immersivenuclear.yellowcake.info=Final product of line 1: uranium concentrate, not enriched. Comes out of the Industrial Dryer (future machine).
jei.immersivenuclear.fluid_upcoming.info=Fluid of the next machines of the line (chemical separation, effluent treatment and drying). For now it can only be stored in tanks.
